SUMMARY:Mambernetics Dragon Con Watch Party 
DESCRIPTION:**UPDATED to 8PM EASTERN** I will be doing a monthly get together at 8PM Eastern once a month on the last Friday of the month. The main purpose of this is to expose folks to a variety of different things one might do at Dragon Con as well as get a vibe feeling and such by presenting a curated list of videos from DragonConTV and Youtube.\nWhen I did this last time\, the sound for this wasn't great in Discord so this time I am going to try in teams. Here is the link:\nhttps://teams.microsoft.com/meet/29594567120815?p=dhVJ9U2tDfLfxPLXUo\n
LOCATION:https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/29594567120815?p=dhVJ9U2tDfLfxPLXUo
